{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:a17308c3f1e02dda","name":"Jedi Instructor Talent Tree","source":{"id":"source:reference-a17308c3f1e02dda","title":"Jedi Instructor Talent Tree","revision":25996,"timestamp":"2025-01-14T21:26:42Z","sha256":"91b24f57e60320aec4c5cc398c9e9cb49f861e39368c7e99ef0b01f4c844b75f","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=25996","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Jedi%20Instructor%20Talent%20Tree&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-a17308c3f1e02dda","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Jedi Academy Training Manual"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Jedi_Academy_Training_Manual"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The role of teacher is vital to the success and strength of ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Jedi Order"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Jedi_Order"},". Though all ",{"tag":"a","children":["Jedi Masters"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Jedi_Masters"}," take the time to instruct their apprentices, a certain few excel at the art of instruction.\n"]},"\n\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Core Talents"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Apprentice Boon"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Whenever an ally within 12 squares with a lower ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use the Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_the_Force","referenceId":"reference:74883d1dd46b87fe"}," skill bonus than you makes a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use the Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_the_Force","referenceId":"reference:74883d1dd46b87fe"}," check, you can spend a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Point"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Point"}," as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reaction"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reaction"}," to add to that ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use the Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_the_Force","referenceId":"reference:74883d1dd46b87fe"}," check. Use your level to determine how many dice to roll for the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Point"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Point"},".\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Share Force Secret"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," At least 1 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Secret"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Secret"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["When you take this Talent, choose one ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Secret"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Secret"}," that you know. Once per turn as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Swift Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Swift_Action"},", you can grant the use of this ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Secret"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Secret"}," to one ally within 12 squares of you who is ",{"tag":"a","children":["Trained"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Trained"}," in the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use the Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_the_Force","referenceId":"reference:74883d1dd46b87fe"}," skill. The target gains the benefit of this ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Secret"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Secret"}," until the end of your next turn.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Share Force Technique"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," At least 1 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Technique"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Technique"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["When you take this Talent, choose one ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Technique"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Technique"}," that you know. Once per turn as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Swift Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Swift_Action"},", you can grant the use of this ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Technique"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Technique"}," to one ally within 12 squares of you who is ",{"tag":"a","children":["Trained"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Trained"}," in the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use the Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_the_Force","referenceId":"reference:74883d1dd46b87fe"}," skill. The target gains the benefit of this ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Technique"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Technique"}," until the end of your next turn. You cannot choose ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Point Recovery"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Point_Recovery","referenceId":"reference:13b554fe3303253b"}," for this Talent.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Share Jedi Talent"]},"\n",{"tag":"table","children":["\n\n",{"tag":"tbody","children":[{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["This section was titled Share Talent in its official source, but has been renamed to distinguish it from the similarly named \"",{"tag":"a","children":["Share Talent"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Share_Talent"},".\""]}]},"\n"]}]}]}]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," At least 1 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Talent"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Talent"}," from ",{"tag":"a","children":["Lightsaber Combat Talent Tree"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Lightsaber_Combat_Talent_Tree","referenceId":"reference:11614943ef3f899e"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Duelist Talent Tree"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Duelist_Talent_Tree","referenceId":"reference:5c1f05597abfb6ef"},", or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Lightsaber Forms Talent Tree"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Lightsaber_Forms_Talent_Tree","referenceId":"reference:d7f7f3ce518ae2f9"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Choose a Talent that you already possess. The Talent you select must be from the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Lightsaber Combat Talent Tree"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Lightsaber_Combat_Talent_Tree","referenceId":"reference:11614943ef3f899e"},", the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Duelist Talent Tree"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Duelist_Talent_Tree","referenceId":"reference:5c1f05597abfb6ef"},", or the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Lightsaber Forms Talent Tree"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Lightsaber_Forms_Talent_Tree","referenceId":"reference:d7f7f3ce518ae2f9"},". Once per day, as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Standard Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Standard_Action"},", you can spend a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Point"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Point"}," to impart the benefits of the chosen Talent to one or more allies, effectively granting them the Talent (even if they don't meet the prerequisites).\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["An ally must be within 12 squares of you, and must be able to see and hear you to gain the Talent; once gained, its benefits last until the end of the encounter. You can share the Talent with a number of allies equal to one-half your Class Level (rounded down). Only allies who are ",{"tag":"a","children":["Trained"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Trained"}," in the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use the Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_the_Force","referenceId":"reference:74883d1dd46b87fe"}," skill can gain the benefits of the ",{"tag":"b","children":["Shared Jedi Talent"]},".\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You can take this Talent multiple times. Each time you do so, you must select a different Talent to share with this ability. You can share each Talent with your allies only once per day.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Transfer Power"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Training"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Training","referenceId":"reference:24f2c1df8e62fd15"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["As a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Standard Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Standard_Action"},", you can spend any one use of a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Power"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Power"}," currently in your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Power Suite"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Power_Suite"},", adding a use of that ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Power"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Power"}," to the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Power Suite"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Power_Suite"}," of any ally ",{"tag":"a","children":["Trained"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Trained"}," in the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use the Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_the_Force","referenceId":"reference:74883d1dd46b87fe"}," skill. The ally must be within 12 squares of you and in your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Line of Sight"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Line_of_Sight","referenceId":"reference:7ae5eaf79143552f"},". When your ally uses that ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Power"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Power"},", it disappears from his or her ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Power Suite"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Power_Suite"},". If the ally does not use the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Power"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Power"}," before the end of the encounter, it is permanently removed from his or her ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Power Suite"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Power_Suite"},".\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
